<title>TAJIKISTAN: Tajik April unemployment unchanged at 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Tajik April unemployment unchanged at 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUSHANBE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Tajikistan fell to 45,985 people, or 2.4 percent of the workforce at the end of April, from 46,003 people in March, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    TAJIK UNEMPLOYMENT	  Apr 97     Mar 97     Apr 96</p>
<p>    officially registered     45,985     46,003	n/a</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce    2.4	  2.4	  n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
